umpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1826457/000119312526210358/0001193125-26-210358-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-210358"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-1188.5% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1826457/000119312526210358/0001193125-26-210358-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-210358"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $94.1m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1826457/000119312526210358/0001193125-26-210358-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-210358"},{"text":"About 13 months of cash at the current burn ($159.9m against $144.4m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1826457/000119312526210358/0001193125-26-210358-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-210358"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 20.4% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1826457/000119312526210358/0001193125-26-210358-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-210358"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 10.8% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (93,454 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1826457/000119312526307791/0001193125-26-307791-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.8% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1826457/000119312526307791/0001193125-